cytoscape.js 3.34.0
MIT License - full text in cytoscape.LICENSE beside this file.

Source:  https://registry.npmjs.org/cytoscape/-/cytoscape-3.34.0.tgz
         (file taken from package/dist/cytoscape.min.js)
sha1:    5fbe2eb1cf76b070a8ecd5647c35f65aa097c9c6   (of the .tgz, as published)
sha256:  9c2a3bf2592e0b14a1f7bec07c03a54f16dedf32af9cd0af155c716aa6c87bc3   (of cytoscape.min.js)

Vendored unmodified - verified byte-identical to the published tarball.

This is the UMD build, so loading it in a plain <script> defines a global
`cytoscape`. It has no runtime dependencies, which is what lets the generated
page stay a single self-contained file.

Only the layouts built into this file are available: grid, circle, concentric,
breadthfirst, cose, random and preset. fcose, cola, dagre and elk are separate
packages and would each be another vendored file.

To update:
  curl -sL -o cytoscape-<version>.tgz \
    https://registry.npmjs.org/cytoscape/-/cytoscape-<version>.tgz
  # compare against the "shasum" field of
  #   https://registry.npmjs.org/cytoscape
  tar xzf cytoscape-<version>.tgz package/dist/cytoscape.min.js package/LICENSE
  cp package/dist/cytoscape.min.js cytoscape.min.js
  cp package/LICENSE               cytoscape.LICENSE
  # then refresh the version and hashes above
